<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets 300 billion lire bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets 300 billion lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banca Nazionale del Lavoro, Cariplo, San Paolo and Dresdner Bank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.40	MATURITY    03.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.595   PAY DATE    03.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*US/UK/IT/NL/DE</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
